% SOURCE: ICOT TR-524, K. Yoshida, "The SIMPOS Distributed File System -- Its Design and Implementation", Nov. 1989
% PDF page 8, printed folio 7. Section 3.1 "Object-Orientation", in-text example of an ESP method (no figure number).
% Transcribed by eye from 300dpi crop (A/work/tr0524/x08.png). Text says the method is identified as :add_data/2
% counting the receiver (Accessor) as an argument.

:add_data(Accessor, String) :-
     :put_data(Accessor, String),
     :add(Accessor, immediate) ;
